            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added
- **Reply to an OpenCode session from your iPhone.** OpenCode joins Claude Code,
  Codex, Devin, Cursor and Amp — every agent Perch supports can now be typed into
  remotely. Stop is still Claude Code only.

### Fixed
- Security and reliability improvements.
